{
 "id": "universal-crouch-cancel",
 "name": "Crouch cancel",
 "part": "defense",
 "characters": "all",
 "goal": "Crouch through a weak hit and counter before the attacker can act",
 "why": "A hit taken crouching has two thirds of its knockback, and with the stick held down {char} is back on the floor as its freeze ends. The attacker is still in its move: a down tilt, a grab or a down smash comes first. It holds until the damage is high enough that the hit knocks {char} down all the same.",
 "switch": "success",
 "tutorial": {
  "what": "Hold the stick down before the hit and through its freeze. {char} lands at once: then A for a down tilt, Z for a grab, or the C-stick down.",
  "expect": "Each hit is judged after its freeze: whether {char} was crouching and on the floor, and how soon the counter came. In one part the damage is high, and the same hits knock a crouching {char} down.",
  "example": [
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     -1
    ],
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": "HIT+HC+LAND+3"
   },
   {
    "press": "A",
    "frame": "HC+LAND+1",
    "hold": 1,
    "from": "start"
   }
  ],
  "marks": {
   "1": "Frame 1: the stick down. {char} crouches",
   "HIT": "Frame {HIT}: {move} hits. The freeze: {HC} frames",
   "HIT+HC": "Frame {HIT+HC}: the freeze is over. {char} lands",
   "HIT+HC+LAND": "Frame {HIT+HC+LAND}: the landing is over. A: a down tilt"
  },
  "lessons": [
   {
    "title": "Crouch cancel",
    "text": [
     "A hit taken crouching has two thirds of its knockback, and freezes {char} two thirds as long.",
     "With the stick still down when the freeze ends, {char} is put back on the floor at once: a landing of {LAND} frames. Taken standing, the same hit lifts {char} into the air, in hitstun and open to the next one."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "stick": [
         0,
         -1
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": "HIT+HC+2"
       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: the stick down. {char} crouches",
       "HIT": "Frame {HIT}: {move} hits. The freeze: {HC} frames",
       "HIT+HC": "Frame {HIT+HC}: the freeze is over. {char} lands"
      },
      "cues": [
       {
        "frames": [
         1,
         "HIT-1"
        ],
        "words": "Crouching",
        "kind": "info"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         "HIT",
         "HIT+HC-1"
        ],
        "words": "The freeze: keep the stick down",
        "kind": "go"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         "HIT+HC",
         "HIT+HC+LAND-1"
        ],
        "words": "Landing: a press here is ignored",
        "kind": "info"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "title": "The counter",
    "text": [
     "The attacker is still in its move when {char} lands. {LAND} frames after the landing {char} can act.",
     "With the stick still down, A is a down tilt. Z is a grab; the C-stick down, a down smash. A press during the landing is ignored."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "stick": [
         0,
         -1
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": "HIT+HC+LAND+3"
       },
       {
        "press": "A",
        "frame": "HC+LAND+1",
        "hold": 1,
        "from": "start"
       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: the stick down. {char} crouches",
       "HIT": "Frame {HIT}: {move} hits. The freeze: {HC} frames",
       "HIT+HC": "Frame {HIT+HC}: the freeze is over. {char} lands",
       "HIT+HC+LAND": "Frame {HIT+HC+LAND}: the landing is over. A: a down tilt"
      },
      "cues": [
       {
        "frames": [
         1,
         "HIT-1"
        ],
        "words": "Crouching",
        "kind": "info"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         "HIT",
         "HIT+HC-1"
        ],
        "words": "The freeze: keep the stick down",
        "kind": "go"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         "HIT+HC",
         "HIT+HC+LAND-1"
        ],
        "words": "Landing: a press here is ignored",
        "kind": "info"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         "HIT+HC+LAND",
         "HIT+HC+LAND+5"
        ],
        "words": "A, Z or the C-stick down now",
        "kind": "go"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "title": "Where it stops",
    "text": [
     "Knockback grows with damage. Once two thirds of it still sends {char} tumbling, crouching no longer holds: {char} is knocked down.",
     "Here, at {PCT}%, {move} does that. From there on the answer is the shield, or staying out of reach."
    ],
    "scenario": 5,
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "stick": [
         0,
         -1
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 40
       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: the stick down. {char} crouches",
       "HIT": "Frame {HIT}: {move} hits, at {PCT}%"
      },
      "cues": [
       {
        "frames": [
         "HIT",
         "HIT+HC-1"
        ],
        "words": "The freeze",
        "kind": "info"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         "HIT+HC",
         "HIT+40"
        ],
        "words": "Knocked down: crouching does not hold here",
        "kind": "late"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  ]
 },
